[{"title":"征夫词","author":"刘绩","text":"征夫语征妇，死生不可知。\n欲慰泉下魂，但视褓中儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32344,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征妇词","author":"刘绩","text":"征妇语征夫，有身当徇国。\n君为塞下土，妾作山头石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32345,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双行缠","author":"刘绩","text":"色丝深文罗，持作双行缠。\n系侬白玉胫，步步作春妍。\n绣缠合欢带，足底生莲花。\n自踏君门户，更不由狭斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32346,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为北郭悼亡","author":"刘绩","text":"独坐思芳辰，莺花笑冷春。\n自从妆阁闭，谁拂镜台尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32347,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书扇","author":"刘绩","text":"家远绿川长，回舟菡萏香。\n缓声歌白苧，明月堕横塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32348,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻唐愚士除翰林侍读却寄","author":"刘绩","text":"看鍊神丹骨已成，新骑云鹤上蓬瀛。\n山中旧伴头将白，遥瞩非烟想佩声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32349,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画马","author":"刘绩","text":"曾蹴交河度黑山，霜蹄飒飒汗斑斑。\n如今四海无征战，老向春风十二闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32350,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十月十八日出都城途中写怀","author":"刘师邵","text":"驱车出都门，落日临高城。\n客怀方郁纡，悠悠赴修程。\n四顾原野茫，萧萧北风鸣。\n恋阙首重回，怀人恨难平。\n岂无万言书，亦足干圣明。\n上将补衮衣，下欲请长缨。\n君子贵安分，苟禄非所荣。\n出处会有时，屑屑徒自轻。\n扁舟归去来，乡山望中横。\n濯缨发浩歌，沧浪有馀清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32351,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镜湖丹室为周良医仲方赋","author":"刘师邵","text":"浩浩镜湖水，东流接扶桑。\n矫首望不极，三山海中央。\n上有列仙侣，楼居郁相当。\n若人从之游，鸾鹤参翱翔。\n授以养生诀，示以金丹方。\n后天可不老，寿命凋三光。\n稽山孕灵秀，爰兹构丹房。\n凿云以为牖，结露以为梁。\n左控金虎伏，右提苍龙骧。\n渴饮驻金波，饥餐截松肪。\n丹成贮龙鼎，五色烂辉煌。\n鬼神不敢窥，禁卫呵不祥。\n服食炼精魄，身轻欲飞扬。\n手握造化枢，一举超八荒。\n我愿得此剂，持之献明堂。\n上以延万寿，下以惠三殇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32352,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琴月轩","author":"刘师邵","text":"琴中有真趣，不待徽轸全。\n琴中有至音，不待宫羽宣。\n凭轩抚孤桐，皓月当空悬。\n秋高夜寥寥，万籁俱寂然。\n掩抑三四声，志在太古先。\n栖凤翔高梧，潜蛟起重渊。\n高山何峨峨，流水复涓涓。\n相逢尽聋俗，孰知妙入玄。\n子期去已遥，牙氏终绝弦。\n此意当自得，勿为昧者传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32353,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"休理妆","author":"刘师邵","text":"婉婉青楼女，秀质淑且明。\n轻云粲朝日，光彩何新鲜。\n云胡不自贵，修饰以为妍。\n竞为时世妆，皎皎当市缠。\n螓首耀膏沐，蛾眉斗婵娟。\n妆成不自见，窃为他人怜。\n尝蒙冶容诲，令德何由宣。\n盍思守闺闼，永谢朱与铅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32354,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题仙山楼观图","author":"刘师邵","text":"宇宙开新域，星辰隐上台。\n群峰罗窈窕，列嶂拥崔嵬。\n玉观参差耸，琳宫次第开。\n佩声霞外响，幢影日边来。\n王母回鸾驭，秦娥集凤台。\n悬枝珠作网，缀地锦为苔。\n树挽千峰雾，泉轰万壑雷。\n地疑连阆苑，山似接蓬莱。\n真境殊难遇，新诗岂易裁。\n抽毫聊短述，深愧谪仙才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32355,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游静海寺","author":"刘师邵","text":"祇园通辇道，绛刹耸崔嵬。\n日月瞻天近，烟霞接地回。\n黄金铺净域，白玉甃层台。\n池涌青莲现，窗临碧树开。\n塔凌霄汉起，钟唤海潮回。\n天女将花至，龙王献宝来。\n佛灯澄霁月，僧呗隐春雷。\n香积分厨供，醍醐荐茗杯。\n波光摇演漾，林影共徘徊。\n听法谁能难，题诗强自裁。\n雄期过雁宕，胜已压天台。\n寄谢同游侣，何年此重陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32356,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜陈少尹致仕还赋此奉寄","author":"刘师邵","text":"官满一身轻，悬车称野情。\n家传新政谱，坛续旧诗盟。\n鸟倦飞还息，鸥驯妥不惊。\n翻惭形役者，驱逐尚营营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32357,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠开元寺隆上人 其一","author":"刘师邵","text":"自向钱塘住，相将廿载馀。\n息来诸妄断，老去万缘疏。\n洗竹通幽径，搴藤补弊庐。\n时时得佳句，还向壁间书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32358,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠开元寺隆上人 其二","author":"刘师邵","text":"诸方游欲遍，栖息此山中。\n已悟法皆幻，定知身是空。\n窗鸣蕉叶雨，帘捲枳花风。\n亦是耽閒者，清言喜暂同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32359,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄王内悦先生时方待诏公车","author":"刘师邵","text":"鳌背神山接绛霞，每瞻辰极想京华。\n祥烟色借宫城柳，湛露香浮御苑花。\n天乐迥传双凤阙，云绥遥驻六龙车。\n明光奏技多如雨，应数王褒颂最佳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32360,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦梅","author":"刘师邵","text":"冰魂雪态自娉婷，梦入东风感使星。\n春掩残香烟漠漠，曙分疏影月冥冥。\n金虫焰短摇丝幔，宝鸭薰微袅钿屏。\n一枕幽情诗思窅，翠禽啁唽唤初醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32361,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"刘师邵","text":"谁弄参差管，声悲引恨长。\n夜深龙起听，明月满潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32362,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小画","author":"刘师邵","text":"雨馀溪树凉，落日水清浅。\n浩歌归去来，心随楚云远。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32363,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自君之出矣","author":"刘师邵","text":"自君之出矣，日日盼征鞍。\n思君如风烛，有泪不曾乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32364,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青楼怨","author":"刘师邵","text":"青楼连十里，珠薄上银钩。\n此中多乐事，郎从何处游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32365,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"商妇词","author":"刘师邵","text":"君心若流水，妾心如落花。\n风波千万里，相逐遍天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32366,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫人斜","author":"刘师邵","text":"粉埋红艳骨埋香，草色非春亦自芳。\n莫道生前恩宠薄，马嵬尘土更堪伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32367,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题子陵图","author":"刘师邵","text":"汉祚中兴竟灭新，云台勋业耸嶙峋。\n英雄尽入丹青手，难貌羊裘把钓人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32368,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀潭讲师","author":"刘师邵","text":"青萝寺里白头僧，净业真堪继祖灯。\n不出山门将十载，壁问长挂一枝藤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32369,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其一 金莲菊","author":"张黼","text":"洛浦歌残不见人，秋风三径露香新。\n天然富贵无雕饰，羞逐齐宫锦袜尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32370,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其二 玉英菊","author":"张黼","text":"独对霜篱坐日曛，秋风三径思缤纷。\n琼楼十二天何处，欲寄瑶华隔暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32371,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其三 托叶西施菊","author":"张黼","text":"艳质新移自苧罗，独留亡国恨偏多。\n秋来何处看遗迹，寂寂无言敛翠蛾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32372,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其四 醉杨妃菊","author":"张黼","text":"秋园晞露月将高，被面馀酣尚未消。\n无复三郎重顾笑，艳妆空似海棠娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32373,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其五 太真菊","author":"张黼","text":"千载嵬坡起断魂，黄冠犹带土尘痕。\n篱边笑领金钱赐，正是新承雨露恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32374,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其六 喜容菊","author":"张黼","text":"宝脸初匀腻粉轻，含娇倚态漫多情。\n相逢一笑西风里，犹自能倾下蔡城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32375,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其七 绯桃菊","author":"张黼","text":"登高才罢重徘徊，为爱深红绕径开。\n落日馀酣迷处所，祇疑误入武陵来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32376,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其八 白牡丹菊","author":"张黼","text":"玉露凝辉粉艳新，芳魂无意近阳春。\n只愁野鹿重衔去，零落秋香逐路尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32377,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其九 胭脂菊","author":"张黼","text":"甘谷仙归阿母家，夜开聊简试丹砂。\n芳唇丽脸争春态，不用东风驻岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32378,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其十 罗盖菊","author":"张黼","text":"幕幕团阴采采花，秋深空倚曲栏斜。\n若为借得东风便，飘逐春云拥翠华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32379,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其十一 金钱菊","author":"张黼","text":"六宫欢笑破春颜，正是君王赐阿环。\n惆怅龙文千载后，却随秋卉落人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32380,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸菊咏十二首 其十二 金丝菊","author":"张黼","text":"作茧抽香半未齐，秋来不上玉人机。\n露寒三径西风?，留得团花待白衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32381,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次饮酒怀古韵答张子英","author":"陈景融","text":"日月不我与，光阴年复年。\n不知千载后，孰识千载前。\n寓怀一杯酒，醉来颓其肩。\n死生固虚诞，彭殇亦徒然。\n及时不勉励，老大悲迁延。\n营营世上人，纷纷愚与贤。\n贵贱各自适，出处难同传。\n浩歌且复饮，赋命存乎天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32382,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵暮春","author":"陈景融","text":"春风官路马蹄轻，拙宦归来恨莫平。\n呼酒且判今日醉，看花又动昔年情。\n朋游老去鸥盟冷，世事于今蝶梦惊。\n取紫拾青男子事，便应投笔效班生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32383,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双清图","author":"陈景融","text":"玉树花香璧月圆，绣衣深映色清妍。\n窗涵疏影孤山夜，人在澄光万里天。\n云母帐虚沈画角，水精帘净湿冰弦。\n广寒高处应难到，立遍阑干醉不眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32384,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云山图二首 其一","author":"陈景融","text":"青山寂无言，白云自舒卷。\n对此淡忘归，何心在轩冕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32385,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云山图二首 其二","author":"陈景融","text":"云拥青山远，风生碧树凉。\n悠悠高世士，矫首意何长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32386,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真长望月图","author":"陈景融","text":"羽衣何蹁跹，悠悠坐林樾。\n浩歌天地间，清风共明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32387,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看云图","author":"陈景融","text":"世态炎凉总不知，此心惟与白云期。\n千岩万壑无人迹，慷慨登临有所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32388,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云山图","author":"陈景融","text":"浮世茫茫自古今，红尘不到白云深。\n挂冠神武归来后，随意看山憩树阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32389,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江独钓","author":"陈景融","text":"云山万叠水烟空，白鸟飞边思莫穷。\n未遇君王后车载，钓丝黄叶共秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32390,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙女醉归图","author":"陈景融","text":"碧桃花下宴初还，云御逍遥拥侍环。\n两鬓天风吹不醒，肯教清梦落人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32391,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夫子听琴师襄图","author":"陈颢","text":"苍姬尚文治，叔世生宣尼。\n立教以垂宪，天纵圣哲资。\n师襄何许人，冠裳肃威仪。\n援琴得高趣，挥手调朱丝。\n悠悠太古音，不藉言与词。\n松阴白日永，萧瑟生凉飔。\n一弹万虑息，再弹心旷怡。\n乐与二三子，听之忘神疲。\n世远不可作，此音知者稀。\n抚图三叹息，长吟寄遐思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32392,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泣麟图","author":"陈颢","text":"诗亡春秋作，姬政日就堕。\n麟也本仁兽，出焉非所宜。\n夫子因感伤，临风涕交颐。\n画史载遗迹，千古兴嗟咨。\n方今圣人出，端拱致无为。\n岂独麟瑞世，凤凰亦来仪。\n往事勿复论，作诗颂明时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32393,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其一","author":"陈颢","text":"旷达不世士，性本爱丘山。\n一为利禄縻，役役簿领间。\n田园已将荒，不归诚厚颜。\n敛裳中宵逝，遥遥驾舟还。\n矫首睇孤鸿，高举谢尘樊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32394,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其二","author":"陈颢","text":"舍舟履平陆，行李相追随。\n原野何萧条，晨光亦熹微。\n前途问征夫，载欣复载驰。\n吾庐已在眼，僮仆候柴扉。\n新归且慰意，奚论昨是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32395,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其三","author":"陈颢","text":"故庐南山下，三径已就荒。\n惟存旧松菊，萧萧历风霜。\n入室携幼稚，嬉笑牵衣裳。\n怡颜盼庭柯，寄傲倚南窗。\n床头有旨酒，陶然酣一觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32396,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其四","author":"陈颢","text":"束带事趋谒，素志恒乖违。\n迷途实未远，遂兹故园归。\n榆柳纷掩映，兰菊相因依。\n俗辙稀往来，竟日掩柴扉。\n复得反自然，谅匪造化私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32397,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其五","author":"陈颢","text":"解印归故园，行行循旧踪。\n扶老藉筇竹，流憩挹松风。\n矫首踪遐观，湛然天镜空。\n乌兔奚逼人，飞走西复东。\n丈夫贵适意，畴能困樊笼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32398,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其六","author":"陈颢","text":"天末云冉冉，林端鸟翩翩。\n云出既为雨，鸟飞亦知旋。\n君子识其微，进退合自然。\n靖节旷世高，素翁当代贤。\n出处虽异途，德音可同传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32399,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其七","author":"陈颢","text":"先人手栽树，势若蛟龙蟠。\n苔蚀鳞甲紫，声号风雨寒。\n别尔忽已久，归哉此盘桓。\n日入景翳翳，抚之欲舍难。\n但愿坚晚节，不必封秦官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32400,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其八","author":"陈颢","text":"素志本丘壑，荣名非所谋。\n进退适其宜，谅不愧前修。\n言归柴桑里，避喧息交游。\n与世渐相违，驾言复焉求。\n取乐在琴尊，不顾身外忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32401,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其九","author":"陈颢","text":"游宦去乡邑，谁不念同侪。\n道路阻且修，遂俾良晤乖。\n爰归得聚首，谈笑情相谐。\n琴书日在眼，抚玩适我怀。\n以兹消百忧，㗳然外形骸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32402,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其十","author":"陈颢","text":"安居谢声利，人人羡其高。\n诗酒得真乐，庐舍无喧嚣。\n孤舟出前溪，巾车驾东皋。\n渊鱼乐洋洋，枝鸟鸣交交。\n欣然览时物，天地同逍遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32403,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题侯贰守归去来辞画 其十一","author":"陈颢","text":"不为三径荒，决志亦念归。\n归来身我有，悟昨事皆非。\n晨兴出门去，放迹信杖藜。\n寻壑既窈窕，经丘复逶迤。\n于焉乐吾乐，舍此复何之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32404,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦登名山","author":"陈颢","text":"瀛洲信难求，天姥或可睹。\n朝谈谪仙诗，夜梦游仙坞。\n烟萝百尺手自攀，飞步直上青云端。\n瑶草香浮碧烟暖，松风怒作秋涛寒。\n踰千岩兮历万壑，四顾无人自盘礴。\n羽衣丹顶双皋禽，戛然长鸣溯寥廓。\n我欲因之纵攀跻，空中恍惚闻天鸡。\n豁然惊觉失所在，天青月落银潢低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32405,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观瀑图","author":"陈颢","text":"碧落无尘秋气高，白云捲空如海涛。\n山人避俗事幽讨，眼明八极穷秋毫。\n就中匡庐有佳色，飞流倒泻三千尺。\n初惊白虹饮涧泉，又疑玉龙挂岩壁。\n万里长风吹不收，坐令毛骨寒飕飕。\n漆园傲吏去已远，长庚仙人今在不。\n我生素志亦丘壑，苦因笔砚相缠缚。\n何当卜邻如此图，听水看山一生乐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32406,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉时歌春夜宴周元亮客轩作","author":"陈颢","text":"香径无尘雨初歇，海棠半谢胭脂雪。\n千年一刻度春宵，爱杀清妍柳梢月。\n苕溪仙客文中英，面如玉盘双眼青。\n金龟换酒不自酌，芳筵罗列邀佳朋。\n座中谈笑总超俗，咳唾随风散珠玉。\n姚郎起舞伍君歌，击鼓催觞令行速。\n四明客子醉欲颠，仰看北斗低青天。\n葛巾吹堕落花里，玉山倒向东风前。\n人生得意要须乐，底用閒愁时作恶。\n君不见三闾大夫独醒死，留得虚名亦徒尔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32407,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"络纬吟","author":"陈颢","text":"梧桐叶黄风露清，槿花篱落莎鸡鸣。\n花间叶底振双羽，夜凉何处无秋声。\n秋声嘈嘈断还续，非丝桐兮复非竹。\n冰茧春缲槛外车，寒机晓转窗前轴。\n贫家少妇魂梦惊，起来搔头向月明。\n南邻北舍悄无语，听此凄凉泪暗倾。\n去年养蚕抵作赋，一丝不得添襦裤。\n破衣无絮过残冬，儿女啼寒双肘露。\n今年二月卖新丝，卖丝得米充腹饥。\n荒居萧条生理薄，冬来依旧寒无衣。\n红楼女儿好颜色，银甲弹筝按商拍。\n满身罗绮倩人扶，十指何曾亲纺绩。\n秋宵沈沈更漏迟，牙床醉枕珊瑚欹。\n芙蓉花娇殢春梦，耳边那暇听莎鸡。\n莎鸡年年报秋节，岂识人间欢怨别。\n人间欢怨可奈何，一笑长歌醉明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32408,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]